docs {
  # Mitra Kerja Riset API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen mitra kerja riset.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/mitra-kerja-riset`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | / | ✅ | All | List dengan pagination |
  | GET | /all | ✅ | All | List semua (dropdown) |
  | GET | /:id | ✅ | All | Detail by ID |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Admin | Buat mitra |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Update mitra |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Hapus mitra |
}
